    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge</strong> - brutally hard pogo-stick platformer. Fall, rage, climb again \u2014 no checkpoints, only pain and skill.<br><br>You're a bald man with one goal: reach the top.<br>No excuses.\u00a0No mercy. Just you \u2014 and your will to succeed. <br><br>Control your jumps using only the mouse. Bunnyhop and choose the right angle.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/99bdc2adb7ef971ad01d2088ddaeeacf.poster.avif?t=1755235950\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/99bdc2adb7ef971ad01d2088ddaeeacf.webm?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/99bdc2adb7ef971ad01d2088ddaeeacf.mp4?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Mouse-only control \u2014 simple to use, hard to master</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f0 A route that demands patience and precision</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Progress depends only on you \u2014 the more you play, the better you become</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want hardcore? Play solo.</strong><br><br>Here, cold calculation and patience are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to jump and fall together? Turn on multiplayer.</strong><br><br>It's the same climb \u2014 but with company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Multiplayer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea2 Rope \u2014 pull your friend up or mess with them</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Collisions \u2014 turn them on for fun or off for clean climbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 Share the rage and the laugh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/5bc6c71d7f5eff2e5e193590d54f0b78.poster.avif?t=1755235950\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/5bc6c71d7f5eff2e5e193590d54f0b78.webm?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/5bc6c71d7f5eff2e5e193590d54f0b78.mp4?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Don't expect an easy walk.<br>But with every mistake, you get more precise.<br>With every attempt \u2014 higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision is power. Patience is victory.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge</strong> - brutally hard pogo-stick platformer. Fall, rage, climb again \u2014 no checkpoints, only pain and skill.<br><br>You're a bald man with one goal: reach the top.<br>No excuses.\u00a0No mercy. Just you \u2014 and your will to succeed. <br><br>Control your jumps using only the mouse. Bunnyhop and choose the right angle.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/99bdc2adb7ef971ad01d2088ddaeeacf.poster.avif?t=1755235950\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/99bdc2adb7ef971ad01d2088ddaeeacf.webm?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/99bdc2adb7ef971ad01d2088ddaeeacf.mp4?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 Mouse-only control \u2014 simple to use, hard to master</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f0 A route that demands patience and precision</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Progress depends only on you \u2014 the more you play, the better you become</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want hardcore? Play solo.</strong><br><br>Here, cold calculation and patience are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to jump and fall together? Turn on multiplayer.</strong><br><br>It's the same climb \u2014 but with company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Multiplayer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Up to 4 players</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea2 Rope \u2014 pull your friend up or mess with them</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Collisions \u2014 turn them on for fun or off for clean climbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 Share the rage and the laugh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/5bc6c71d7f5eff2e5e193590d54f0b78.poster.avif?t=1755235950\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/5bc6c71d7f5eff2e5e193590d54f0b78.webm?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/5bc6c71d7f5eff2e5e193590d54f0b78.mp4?t=1755235950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Don't expect an easy walk.<br>But with every mistake, you get more precise.<br>With every attempt \u2014 higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision is power. Patience is victory.</strong></p>",
